%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral', 'themeVariables': {'fontFamily': 'Inter, system-ui', 'lineWidth': '2'}}}%%
%% Title: Composite Preflight Field Priority And Normalization Compatibility Resolution
%% @version 1.1.0
%% @date    2026-10-09
%% Reviewed against main 9a7339dc: composite/preflight_validator.py, _preflight_field_priority.py and _preflight_orchestration.py
%% @type    sequenceDiagram
%% @level   System / Interaction
%% @nodes   7
%% RULES: RULES.md §2.6, ADR-026, ADR-034, ADR-045
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CLI as run_composite command
    participant Runner as CompositePipelineRunner
    participant Validator as CompositePreflightValidationService
    participant Profiles as source_profiles
    participant Overrides as normalization_compatibility_overrides
    participant Schema as PreflightSchemaOrchestrationMixin
    participant Report as PreflightValidationReportingMixin

    CLI->>Runner: run composite config
    Runner->>Validator: validate(config)
    Validator->>Schema: collect schema / profile refs
    Schema-->>Validator: schema field refs
    Validator->>Schema: _load_source_profiles(config)
    Schema->>Profiles: resolve normalization profile identities
    Profiles-->>Validator: profile identities
    Validator->>Validator: _get_valid_sources(config)
    Validator->>Validator: _validate_field_priority(...)
    loop each field priority
        Validator->>Validator: scan_field_priority(...)
        Validator->>Report: accumulate unknown_source / missing_field issues
        opt no available field dtype
            Validator->>Report: add missing-from-all-sources issue
        end
        opt more than one source dtype
            Validator->>Report: check_type_compatibility / accumulate issue
        end
        Validator->>Overrides: consult reviewed overrides
        opt incompatible profiles without override
            Validator->>Report: add normalization_profile_mismatch
        end
    end
    Validator->>Report: validate aggregation ordering; collect all issues
    Validator-->>Runner: PreflightValidationResult
    Runner-->>CLI: proceed or fail

    Note over Validator,Overrides: Legacy direct-call tests still work through optional source_profiles / compatibility_overrides arguments.
